MediaWiki Gadgets Licensing Map

This repository contains separately licensed material. Copyright ownership and
license scope are not necessarily the same for the workspace, each gadget, and
the shared source package.

CC0-dedicated release scopes

The project-owned portions of the following releases are dedicated under CC0
1.0 Universal by their version-specific package license notices:

- Citation Formatter 0.6.0 (`citation-formatter@0.6.0`)
- VG Page Assessor 0.3.0 (`vg-page-assessor@0.3.0`)
- VG Stub Creator 0.6.0 (`vg-stub-creator@0.6.0`)
- wikEd Lite 0.5.0-post.1 (`wiked-lite@0.5.0-post.1`)

This map lists only the current release scope for each CC0-dedicated gadget.
Earlier version-specific license notices remain available in repository Git
history.

Those notices also cover the project-owned shared runtime incorporated into the
named releases. A version-specific dedication does not automatically apply to
later releases, later contributions, or newly added gadgets.

Repository default

Unless a package-local or file-specific notice says otherwise, the
project-owned repository material is available under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International Public License. This default includes
the root workspace, build infrastructure, tests, configuration, and repository
documentation.

