Shared and third-party material

The current shared-source scopes are described in src/shared/LICENSE.
Generated, extracted, dependency, and other third-party material remains under
its own terms. Nothing in this licensing map grants rights that a repository
maintainer does not hold. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for provenance and
notices.

